  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A person with a weight of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"600 N\"></span> stands on a scale in an elevator.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the acceleration of the elevator when the scale reads <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"900 N\"></span>?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"5.0 m s^{-2}\"></span> downwards</li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.5 m s^{-2}\"></span> downwards</li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.5 m s^{-2}\"></span> upwards</li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"5.0 m s^{-2}\"></span> upwards</li></ol>"
